WEBVTT

00:00:01.512 --> 00:00:12.661
Filter Interactions to calls you can still appeal

00:00:12.661 --> 00:00:20.199
Open the call

00:00:20.199 --> 00:00:23.856
Click Appeal this score

00:00:23.856 --> 00:00:41.104
Tick each parameter you dispute and say why

00:00:41.104 --> 00:00:48.040
Click Review & submit, then Submit appeal

00:00:48.040 --> 00:00:51.880
The appeal waits for a QA. You and your team lead get an email.
